sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as WP Admin UI (Frontend)
    participant Plugin as Context Alt Text Plugin (WP Backend)
    participant Backend as Recognition API (HF Spaces)
    participant Storage as Media Library

    Note over Admin,Backend: ⚠️ Frontend has NO roster management UI - only displays results
    Admin->>Plugin: Open media item in Workbench
    Plugin->>Storage: Load attachment metadata & thumbnail
    Admin->>Plugin: Click "Run Recognition" (bulk action)
    Plugin->>Backend: POST /api/v0/analyze-scene (attachment URL)
    Note over Backend: Backend performs:<br/>1. Face detection<br/>2. Embedding extraction<br/>3. Roster matching<br/>4. Confidence scoring
    Backend-->>Plugin: SceneAnalysisResult (faces, matched roster entries, confidence)
    Plugin->>Storage: Store observations + roster matches locally
    Plugin-->>Admin: Display recognition results (read-only)
    Note over Admin: Frontend shows:<br/>- Matched names from backend roster<br/>- Confidence scores<br/>- Detection bounding boxes<br/>NO roster editing or management
